+
+The mutation parsed and built successfully. Execution reached:
+
+```text
+<k> ref ( 0 ) ~> .K </k>
+<heap> 0 |-> list ( .ValSeq ) </heap>
+<heapLoc> 1 </heapLoc>
+<stack> .List </stack>
+<ret> noRet </ret>
+<exc> NoExc </exc>
